#~ "health insurer. Where the country has an electronic insurability check, run "
#~ "it from the month's billing period or from the resident record: Resthome "
#~ "updates the **health insurer** and the resident's coverage details."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Controleer vóór het factureren of de bewoner wel verzekerd is bij zijn "
